    <briefdescription>
<para>Thread-safe in-memory session storage (testing/development). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stores all sessions in a std::unordered_map protected by mutex. Sessions are lost on process termination; suitable for testing only. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
